Column name: speak_spanish_at_home Type: FLOAT64 Description: Speaks Spanish at Home. The number of people in a geographic area over age 5 who speak Spanish at home, possibly in addition to other languages.
Column name: speak_spanish_at_home_low_english Type: FLOAT64 Description: Speaks Spanish at Home, speaks English less than "very well"
